{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國樂壇天后Taylor Swift與男友Travis Kelce今年7月舉辦世紀婚禮，2人選址在紐約麥迪遜廣場花園（MSG）舉行。</p><p>當時盛傳現場布置耗資約3000萬美元（約2.35億港元），將婚禮現場打造成像是「森林仙境」風格，派頭十足。</p><p>誰</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:41:20.698473+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:31:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:38:20.569224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:38:20.569224+00:00","content_hash":"ab4eee59f5781f5074d527fbf3ea5d5c98008241e16873c9e28b3242ac91e1bc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}